  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "出发前的慌乱  (Panic Before Departure)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "crew": "场务",
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Down in the Xingtian courtyard, the production crew is packed and ready to fly abroad when news of Chun Yuqiao's demotion throws the team into turmoil. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，小谷来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "公告显示老大突然被免职了，到底怎么回事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大伙都集合好了，原本下午就要出发去欧洲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在发生这种事，魅力远航还做不做？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家都先别急，不管发生什么事，都不会影响魅力远航的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "魅力远航是淳于总一手开发的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "兄弟们筹备了这么久，好不容易才立了项。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在淳于总被公司免了职，公司还会继续做这个节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好了，大家都先别吵了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "总编室说不拍了吗？布小谷还在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这件事应该跟之前换掉那个艺人有关，是老大亲自安排的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，小谷来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lin Jie, Xiaogu is here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "公告显示老大突然被免职了，到底怎么回事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The bulletin says the boss was suddenly removed from office—what happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大伙都集合好了，原本下午就要出发去欧洲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone is assembled and was supposed to head for Europe this afternoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在发生这种事，魅力远航还做不做？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With something like this happening now, are we still making Charming Voyage or not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家都先别急，不管发生什么事，都不会影响魅力远航的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone stay calm; whatever happens, it will not affect producing Charming Voyage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "魅力远航是淳于总一手开发的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Charming Voyage is a show Chun Yuqiao developed single-handedly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "兄弟们筹备了这么久，好不容易才立了项。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our crew prepared for so long and barely got the project greenlit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在淳于总被公司免了职，公司还会继续做这个节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that the company has removed Chun Yuqiao, will the company even keep making this show?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好了，大家都先别吵了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, everyone stop shouting first!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "总编室说不拍了吗？布小谷还在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did the Chief Editor's Office say filming is cancelled? Bu Xiaogu is standing right here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这件事应该跟之前换掉那个艺人有关，是老大亲自安排的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This must be connected to replacing that artist earlier, which the boss arranged himself.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，小谷来了！",
      "gap": 0.5
