      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "总编室说不拍了吗？布小谷还在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这件事应该跟之前换掉那个艺人有关，是老大亲自安排的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Lin Jie urges everyone to stop arguing while the crew pieces together how the clash with the spoiled idol sparked the crisis. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
